            <ArticleTitle>BaitsTools: Software for hybridization capture bait design.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/1755-0998.12721</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Nucleic acid hybridization capture is a principal technology in molecular ecology and genomics. Bait design, however, is a nontrivial task and few resources currently exist to automate the process. Here, I present baitstools, an open-source, user-friendly software package to facilitate the design of nucleic acid baits for hybridization capture.</AbstractText>
